Vikram and Betal: The Honest Answer Test (Raw Story)

id: WBX_100145

King Vikram was carrying Betal through the forest once again.

Betal began his story.

“Once there was a teacher who wanted to test his students,” said Betal.

He gave each student a fruit and said, “Go somewhere where no one can see you and eat it.”

All the students went away and came back after some time.

They said they had eaten the fruit.

But one student returned with the fruit still in his hand.

The teacher asked, “Why did you not eat it?”

The student replied, “You said to eat it where no one can see me. But I can always see myself.”

The teacher smiled and said, “You understand honesty.”

He praised the student.

Betal then asked, “Vikram, what made the student different?”

Vikram replied, “He understood that truth is always within us.”

As soon as Vikram spoke, Betal flew back to the tree.

💖 Moral:

Be honest, even when no one is watching.
